      "writtenOn": "2019-10-09T07:16:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this even going to work ? ISTM that this will prevent the module that wants to use this class from parceling this object, so it won\u0027t be able to send it across the process boundary. Worse, it will crash when it tries to call a binder method because the generated implementation of that will try to call this method.",
